{
  "rationale": "Model sensing and actuation as separate plants, then use small deterministic specifications to map sensed obstacle conditions to exactly one safe exploratory or recovery action. Clear exploration defaults to random_walk, obstacle states force one-shot turns, and path_clear returns quickly to exploration. Action states self-loop on path_clear so intended pulses are not preempted, while obstacle events can still force safer recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Use one sensor plant for uncontrollable perception outcomes and one motion plant for controllable motion capabilities.",
    "Use a compact policy specification with clear/search and one-shot recovery states so obstacle reactions are conservative but exploration resumes quickly."
  ],
